      "label": "H3 CP-SAT Model Size Penalty (5x larger at res-8)",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": "/Users/yashvardhan/Personal_Projects/one_day_delivery/docs/M3/M3-GRID-SHAPE-COMPARISON.md",
      "source_location": "Section 4.2",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "H3 resolution 8 (closest to 2km) produces ~810 nodes vs ~150 for rectangular tiles — 5x larger CP-SAT model for identical output quality. No H3 resolution cleanly maps to 2km without this penalty."
    },
